          <span class="wf-badge">MEMBER</span>\u000a                  <span class="wf-badge">재직</span>\u000a                </div>\u000a              </div>\u000a            </div>\u000a          </div>\u000a\u000a          <div class="wf-grid-2">\u000a            <div class="wf-card">\u000a              <div class="wf-title" style="font-size:15px">기본 정보</div>\u000a              <div class="wf-list">\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub" style="width:90px">이메일</span><span class="wf-grow">kim@company.com</span></div>\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub" style="width:90px">부서</span><span class="wf-grow">개발팀</span></div>\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub" style="width:90px">직급</span><span class="wf-grow">사원</span></div>\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub" style="width:90px">입사일</span><span class="wf-grow">2024-03-02</span></div>\u000a              </div>\u000a              <div class="wf-sub" style="margin-top:8px">부서·직급·입사일은 인사담당만 수정할 수 있습니다</div>\u000a            </div>\u000a\u000a            <div class="wf-card">\u000a              <div class="wf-title" style="font-size:15px">연차 현황 (2026년)</div>\u000a              <div class="wf-list">\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub wf-grow">부여</span><span>15일</span></div>\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub wf-grow">사용</span><span>3.5일</span></div>\u000a                <div class="wf-list-item"><span class="wf-sub wf-grow">잔여</span><strong>11.5일</strong></div>\u000a              </div>\u000a              <button class="wf-btn" style="margin-top:12px;width:100%">휴가 내역 보기</button>\u000a            </div>\u000a          </div>\u000a\u000a          <div class="wf-card">\u000a            <div class="wf-row-between">\u000a              <div class="wf-title" style="font-size:15px">연락처</div>\u000a              <span class="wf-badge">본인 수정 가능</span>\u000a            </div>\u000a            <div class="wf-grid-2" style="margin-top:12px">\u000a              <div>\u000a                <div class="wf-sub">휴대전화</div>\u000a                <input class="wf-input" value="010-1234-5678" />\u000a              </div>\u000a              <div>\u000a                <div class="wf-sub">내선번호</div>\u000a                <input class="wf-input" value="1204" />\u000a              </div>\u000a            </div>\u000a            <button class="wf-btn wf-btn-primary" style="margin-top:12px">저장</button>\u000a          </div>\u000a        </main>\u000a    <nav class="wf-tabbar"><button>대시보드</button><button>근태</button><button>휴가</button><button>일정</button><button>조직</button><button>관리</button><button class="active">내 정보</button></nav>\u000a  </div>\u000a</body>\u000a'),7,2,'cms5hqis6000drwddx41t9gta',1785300848481);
